# PAD Robin scripts

When editing `modules/**/scripts/*.robin`, follow `.cursor/skills/pad-robin/SKILL.md`.

## Must

- Valid Robin that pastes into an **empty** PAD desktop flow
- Variable **Name** / Store into: no `%` — use `%Name%` only when referencing
- Strings/paths: `$'''...'''` with `\\` in Windows paths
- Lab 07-style `ON BLOCK ERROR` / action `ON ERROR`: **SET-only** inside handler; Increase / File / AddRow **outside** after a flag
- Never invent action IDs (e.g. `WaitForWindowToOpen`) — use catalog / sibling scripts

## Wait for window (validated)

```robin
WAIT (UIAutomation.WaitForWindow.ToOpenByTitleClass Title: $'''Contoso Invoicing''' Class: $'''''' FocusWindow: True) FOR 30
```

## Contoso / desktop UI

- Prefer bundled `# [ControlRepository][PowerAutomateDesktop]` (Lab 07) + `# pad-lint: allow-desktop-appmask`
- Live `UIAutomation` + `appmask['Contoso Invoicing']['Btn_…']` names must match `ui-map.md`
- Web Lab Hub `WebAutomation` + `appmask` may stay live

## Lint before finish

```powershell
python .cursor/skills/pad-robin/scripts/lint-robin.py <path-to-robin-or-folder>
```

Fix **errors** before stopping.
